  "identifier": "tasteofhomebacky0000olsk",
  "title": "Taste of home backyard grilling : recipes and tips to grill like a pro",
  "creator": "Olski, Jennifer, editor",
  "year": 2006,
  "subject": "Barbecuing",
  "description": [
    "256 pages : 23 cm",
    "Whether you're hosting a backyard barbecue or grilling on the beach, the sizzling sounds and mouth-watering aromas of food cooking on the grill promise a flame-broiled feast without the fuss. From succulent steaks and savory kabobs to finger-lickin' ribs and impressive roasts, Taste of Home's Backyard Grilling features 330 sensational selections for great outdoor entertaining or everyday dining. You'll even find innovative ideas for hot-off-the-grill appetizers and desserts to suit your tastes, along with great grilling tips, informative sidebars and a host of helpful hints",
    "\"A Taste of home/Reader's digest book\"--Title page verso",
    "Includes indexes"
  ],
